{
  "info": {
    "name": "API Gateway – Lab 7",
    "description": "CampusConnect Lab 7 — API Gateway, Service Discovery & Cloud Deployment\n\nStudent ID: 202512053\nCourse: Web Services & SOA Laboratory\n\nAll requests go through the API Gateway on port 8080.\nThe gateway proxies to User (:3001), Product (:3002), and Order (:3003) services.\nMicroservices are NOT directly reachable from outside the Docker network.\n\nTesting sections:\n  1. Gateway Health Check\n  2. Gateway → User Service routes\n  3. Gateway → Product Service routes\n  4. Gateway → Order Service routes\n  5. Error handling: 502/503 on unreachable service\n  6. (Cloud) Re-run against public URL",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 – Gateway Health Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health — Gateway Self-Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{gatewayUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Expected: 200 OK with gateway metadata and service URL config.\nThis endpoint is served by the gateway itself — no proxying."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 – Gateway → User Service",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /users — All Users (via Gateway)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{gatewayUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Gateway proxies GET /users → user-service:3001/users\nExpected: 200 OK with array of users"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /users — Create User (via Gateway)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Bhavika Sainani\",\n  \"email\": \"bhavika@daiict.ac.in\",\n  \"phone\": \"9876543210\",\n  \"role\": \"student\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{gatewayUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Gateway proxies POST /users → user-service:3001/users\nExpected: 201 Created\nCopy the returned 'id' field into the {{userId}} collection variable."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /users — Create User 2 (via Gateway)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Arjun Patel\",\n  \"email\": \"arjun@daiict.ac.in\",\n  \"phone\": \"9123456780\",\n  \"role\": \"student\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{gatewayUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /users/:id — Get User by ID (via Gateway)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
